  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the ground pork and stir fry until it is no longer pink, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, and brown sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "Stir in the chopped Thai basil.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stir fry hot over rice or noodles.",
    "Garnish with additional Thai basil if desired.",
    "Cook pork to an internal temperature of 63°C / 145°F and let it rest for 3 minutes before serving."
